OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F351A1786794515
OL,3,CBattle of Flowers firework finale
OL,4,Ccancelled over fire safety concerns
OL,6,FA fireworks display which was set to
OL,7,Fend this weekend's Battle of Flowers
OL,8,Fin Jersey has been cancelled over
OL,9,Fconcerns about fire safety.
OL,11,FThe event was meant to take place over
OL,12,FSt Aubin's Bay at 10:45 tonight
OL,13,F(Saturday 15 August) after the
OL,14,FMoonlight Parade.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/5
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
