OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,352,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F351A1786794515
OL,3,CBattle of Flowers firework finale
OL,4,Ccancelled over fire safety concerns
OL,6,FThe Battle of Flowers Association say
OL,7,Fthey worked "tirelessly" to carry out
OL,8,Fthe necessary risk assessments and get
OL,9,Fpermissions in place but admit they
OL,10,Fhave been "unable to reach a position
OL,11,Frequired to secure the necessary
OL,12,Flicence" for the display.
OL,14,FIn a statement, the Association said:
OL,15,F"The Battle of Flowers Association has
OL,16,Ftoday taken the difficult decision to
OL,17,Fcancel the planned firework finale at
OL,18,Fthis year's Battle of Flowers
OL,19,FMoonlight Parade.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/5
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,352,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F351A1786794515
OL,3,CBattle of Flowers firework finale
OL,4,Ccancelled over fire safety concerns
OL,6,F"The decision has been made following
OL,7,Fextensive discussions with the
OL,8,Frelevant authorities and stakeholders
OL,9,Fregarding the necessary permissions
OL,10,Fand assurances for the display,
OL,11,Ftogether with the continuing concerns
OL,12,Faround the exceptionally dry
OL,13,Fconditions currently affecting Jersey.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G3/5
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,352,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F351A1786794515
OL,3,CBattle of Flowers firework finale
OL,4,Ccancelled over fire safety concerns
OL,6,F"The Association has worked tirelessly
OL,7,Fover recent weeks with our
OL,8,Fprofessional fireworks contractor,
OL,9,FStarburst, and has undertaken detailed
OL,10,Frisk assessments and planning to
OL,11,Fensure that the proposed display could
OL,12,Fbe delivered safely. The fireworks
OL,13,Fwere planned to be launched from a
OL,14,Fvessel positioned offshore in St
OL,15,FAubin's Bay, with significant safety
OL,16,Fdistances incorporated into the plans
OL,17,Fand the vessel's position capable of
OL,18,Fbeing adjusted according to conditions
OL,19,Fon the day.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G4/5
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,352,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F351A1786794515
OL,3,CBattle of Flowers firework finale
OL,4,Ccancelled over fire safety concerns
OL,6,F"However, despite the considerable
OL,7,Fwork undertaken, we have been unable
OL,8,Fto reach a position required to secure
OL,9,Fthe necessary licence for the display.
OL,11,F"As an Association, the safety of the
OL,12,Fpublic, our exhibitors, volunteers,
OL,13,Fcontractors and emergency services
OL,14,Fmust always come first. We therefore
OL,15,Fbelieve that cancelling the display is
OL,16,Fthe responsible decision."
OL,18,FThe Association say they will be
OL,19,Fadding additional confetti cannons and
OL,20,F"special effects" to make up for the
OL,21,Floss of the fireworks.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G5/5
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
